<title>USA: CS First Boston, Goldman call off joint MBS deal.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston, Goldman call off joint MBS deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said Thursday it has has chosen to terminate a joint commercial mortgage securitization transaction with Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The company said the decision resulted from differences between the two firms over various aspects of managing a joint securitization transaction.</p>
<p>CS First Boston also said it intends to complete a $1.4 billion securitization of commercial and multifamily mortgage loans in June.</p>
</text>
